                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This isn't really a game (since there are no choices to be made), but rather a story—and it’s a great one. The characters, while flawed, are likable (or at least relatable) and getting to watch their growth is heartwarming. The plot is mostly there as a backdrop and serves its purpose well.\n\nI really appreciate the bonus story, which shows that \"happily ever after\" is actually the hard part of a relationship.",
